{title: Holy is the Lord}
{artist: Mark Feezell}
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 68}

Verse 1
Holy is the Lord who reigns in righteousness.
He alone is worthy. He alone is holy.

Verse 2
Worship the King in His holy place, for He alone is worthy.
Holy is the Lord.

Coda
Praise Him forever. Hallelujah.
